      "title": "Make sure .scap is a valid pcapng extension",
      "message": "Make sure .scap is a valid pcapng extension\n\nAdd \".scap\" whereever we have \".pcapng\" and \".ntar\". Place it before\n.ntar since I'm pretty sure there are more files ending in .scap than\nthere are .ntar.\n",
